<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Nguyen Manh Hung</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/</link><description>Recent content on Nguyen Manh Hung</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><managingEditor>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</managingEditor><webMaster>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://nmh4598.github.io/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Data Analytics: Brazilian E-commerce by Olist</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/data_analytics_olist/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/data_analytics_olist/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Unemployment in the US: how to predict the future?</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/modeling_unemploy_us/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/modeling_unemploy_us/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Text analysis of 100,000 financial cases📜</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/nlp_judilibre/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/nlp_judilibre/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Semantic segmentation using UNet from scratch 🛰️</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/resnet50_segmentation/</link><pubDate>Thu, 06 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/resnet50_segmentation/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Do Twitter users reveal feelings towards CAC40 companies?</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/cac40_streamlit/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Mar 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/cac40_streamlit/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Exploring social network analysis for understanding terrorism 🦹</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/terrorist_graphs/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Feb 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/terrorist_graphs/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is social network analysis and how can it be applied to help us understand the structure and dynamics of terrorist networks?&lt;/strong&gt; We&amp;rsquo;ll demystify the basics of centrality, community and show you how it can reveal the inner workings of terrorist groups.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;You can access an interactive Streamlit dashboard here: &lt;a href="https://nmh4598ana.streamlit.app/"&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="terrorist-and-random-network-analysis"&gt;Terrorist and random network analysis&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This project examines terrorist social networks using data available from data information sources in &lt;a href="https://firstmonday.org/ojs/index.php/fm/article/view/941/863"&gt;Valdis Krebs&amp;rsquo; article&lt;/a&gt;. Specifically, we examine the network surrounding the tragic events of &lt;a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attentats_du_11_septembre_2001"&gt;September 11, 2001&lt;/a&gt;. The September 11, 2001 attacks were four Islamist suicide attacks carried out on the same day in the United States. With the dataset, we are able to map a part of the network centered around the &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hijackers_in_the_September_11_attacks"&gt;19 deceased hijackers&lt;/a&gt;. This network gives us an insight into the terrorist organization.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>The most important factors affecting home prices in Seattle 🏡</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/predict_house_boosting/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Feb 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/predict_house_boosting/</guid><description/></item><item><title>What is the secret of the rarest Pokémon🐦?</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/pokemon_kmeans/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/pokemon_kmeans/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Which country pollutes the most with Rshiny interactive map🌱🌎🌻?</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/climate_rshiny/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Mar 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/climate_rshiny/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Decoding Canada's history: web scraping and TF-IDF📜</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/canadian_encyclopedia_web_scraping-/</link><pubDate>Tue, 08 Mar 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/blog/canadian_encyclopedia_web_scraping-/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Bio</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/bio/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/bio/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Hi ✌️&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I graduated with a &lt;a href="https://sites-formations.univ-rennes2.fr/master-mas/"&gt;MSc Data Science, Statistics and Econometrics&lt;/a&gt; from the 🏫 University of Rennes, France. I&amp;rsquo;m passionate about implementing data analysis (exploration, prediction, and inference), developing data visualization tools, and designing machine learning, deep learning algorithms.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;From May 2022 to August 2022, as a Data Scientist intern at &lt;a href="https://welovedatascience.com/"&gt;WeLoveDataSciene&lt;/a&gt;, I embarked on a project to extract meaningful insights from 🖼️ satellite imagery. I implemented routines to download satellite tiles 🛰️ in the &lt;a href="https://statbel.fgov.be/fr/propos-de-statbel/methodologie/classifications/geographie"&gt;NIS9&lt;/a&gt; geographies. I also researched segmentation techniques to identify land types, such as 🥏 water, ☘️ vegetation and estimate area coverage.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Links</title><link>https://nmh4598.github.io/links/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nguyenmanhhung04051998@gmail.com (Nguyen Manh Hung)</author><guid>https://nmh4598.github.io/links/</guid><description>&lt;!-- "I don’t need to know everything, I just need to know where to find it, when I need it." --&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="algorithms"&gt;Algorithms&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-006-introduction-to-algorithms-spring-2020/"&gt;6.006 Introduction To Algorithms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-046j-design-and-analysis-of-algorithms-spring-2015/pages/syllabus/"&gt;6.046J Design And Analysis Of Algorithms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-851-advanced-data-structures-spring-2012/pages/syllabus/"&gt;6.851 Advanced Data Structures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-854j-advanced-algorithms-fall-2005/"&gt;6.854J Advanced Algorithms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="blogs"&gt;Blogs&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://medium.com/airbnb-engineering"&gt;Airbnb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.bytebytego.com/"&gt;Bytebytego&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a hr